cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ShieldSim, please cite it as below, together with the original measurements and transport studies listed in the paper (paper/ShieldSim-lucrare.pdf)."
title: "ShieldSim: an interactive space radiation shielding simulator"
abstract: "Browser-based, one-dimensional engineering model of crew dose (dose equivalent and effective dose) behind multilayer shielding at 36 Solar System locations. Galactic cosmic rays are carried through the shield with a three-component model (primaries, light fragments, neutrons) fitted to published Geant4 transport results; solar particle events come from NASA dose-depth tables. Calibrated on ISS 2016, Curiosity and Chang'e-4, curve shape fitted on MSL cruise and Artemis I, independently validated on ISS 2009-10 and ExoMars TGO (geometric mean model/measured 0.97)."
type: software
